# Native Calculator on the computed layouts (task 014 P4), review only: empty, a long expression, a result of 8 and
# more digits, a long result, an error, then the dimmed clock (DarkTime) over it. At the five default sizes plus
# 1024x600, 800x600 and the 480x800 portrait (2026-10-18: the keypad fills the screen at every size); the 640x480 and
# 480x320 Calculator goldens are in calculator.scene (pinned, unchanged).
title calculator_more
review
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720 480x320 800x600 480x800
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
config dark_time 10
home
launch Calculator
shot calcm_empty
type 12*34
shot calcm_typing
type +(7-2)^2/4
shot calcm_expression
key ENTER
shot calcm_result
key DELETE
type 12345678*9
key ENTER
shot calcm_digits8
key DELETE
type 2/3
key ENTER
shot calcm_long_result
key DELETE
type 123456789+987654321*2-45/3+(7*8)^2-1000000
shot calcm_long_expression
key DELETE
type 1/0
key ENTER
shot calcm_error
screensaver
wait 10600
shot calcm_clock
